  "description": "Approval of details pursuant to Condition 40 (Newham Boys Boxing Club) attached to Planning Consent 21/01628/LA3 dated 18th March 2022.\r\rThis document sets out the interim arrangements implemented to ensure compliance with Condition 40 of planning permission ref. 21/01628/LA3. It provides details of the measures put in place to enable the continued operation of the Newham Boys Boxing Club following their relocation from the John Street development site.\r\rThe submitted document includes:\r\r-  A description of the planning context and relevant condition\r- Background to the relocation of the boxing club\r- Details of the temporary relocation to Plaistow Park Community Centre\r- Information on the fit-out and suitability of the interim facility\r- Details of the licence to occupy arrangements, including funding of rent and utilities\r- Confirmation of how the interim measures maintain continuity of use and mitigate planning risk\r- An update on the current position and the delivery of the permanent facility at Arragon Road\r\rNo additional drawings or supporting documents are included as part of this submission, aside from any plans or appendices embedded within the Interim Measures Plan itself.",
